<item><title>Sao Tome police detain four over suspected illegal sand extraction</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-police-detain-four-over-suspected-illegal-sand-6d500e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-police-detain-four-over-suspected-illegal-sand-6d500e/</guid><category>Sao Tome and Principe</category><description>The law requires a licence or authorisation to remove sand, with environmental compensation and possible criminal liability also at issue.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:33:32 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" length="38731" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/st.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>São Tomé plans solar mini-grids for three isolated communities</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-plans-solar-mini-grids-for-three-isolated-f55aee/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-plans-solar-mini-grids-for-three-isolated-f55aee/</guid><category>Sao Tome and Principe</category><description>The project will add or improve solar power with battery storage, while officials prepare a tariff model for the future systems.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:33:15 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-plans-solar-mini-grids-for-three-isolated-f55aee/share.jpg" length="43117" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/st/sao-tome-plans-solar-mini-grids-for-three-isolated-f55aee/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
